Package: brainconn
Title: Plotting Tool for Brain Connectivity Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(person("Sidhant", "Chopra", email = "sidhantchopra4@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Plots brain connectivity data: static 3D renders of brain networks in the
    style of BrainNet Viewer, interactive 3D plots with highlighting, 2D plots,
    chord diagrams and connectivity matrices grouped by network. Includes many
    commonly used MNI-space brain atlases, and works with custom atlases and brain
    meshes of any species.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5),
    ggraph
License: MIT + file LICENSE
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
